{
  "name": "Daily ATS Hiring Signals Alert (25K+ Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby & SmartRecruiters)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily B2B Target-Account Hiring Signals (25K+ ATS Index)\n\n**How to set up (2 min):**\n1. Create an **HTTP Header Auth** credential: Header Name = `Authorization`, Value = `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`.\n2. Edit `companies` (plain names auto-resolved across 25,700+ Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby & SmartRecruiters boards) and trigger `keywords` (`AI`, `Security`, `VP`).\n3. Connect Slack and activate the weekday schedule.\n\nActor docs: https://apify.com/clearstack-data/career-site-jobs-search",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "setup-sticky-note",
      "name": "Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "daily-trigger",
      "name": "Every Weekday at 08:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/clearstack-data~career-site-jobs-search/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\"companies\":[\"Stripe\",\"OpenAI\",\"Anthropic\",\"Palantir\",\"Linear\",\"Datadog\",\"Notion\",\"Figma\"],\"keywords\":[\"AI\",\"Security\",\"VP\",\"Head of\"],\"remoteOnly\":false,\"maxJobsTotal\":50,\"onlyNewSinceLastRun\":true,\"monitorStateName\":\"target-accounts\"}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "call-ats",
      "name": "Check New Target Account Openings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "if (!items.length) return [];\nconst lines = items.slice(0, 15).map(i => {\n  const j = i.json;\n  return `- *${j.company}* [${j.ats}]: *${j.title}* (${j.location || 'Unspecified'}) -> ${j.applyUrl}`;\n});\nreturn [{ json: { text: `*New Target Account Hiring Signals (${items.length})*\\n` + lines.join('\\n') } }];"
      },
      "id": "format-slack",
      "name": "Format Hiring Signals Digest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        740,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "channel": "#hiring-signals",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}"
      },
      "id": "send-slack",
      "name": "Send to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        980,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every Weekday at 08:00": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check New Target Account Openings",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check New Target Account Openings": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format Hiring Signals Digest",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Format Hiring Signals Digest": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send to Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
